        "id": 1659435
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-03-24T08:13:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I already sent https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Bluetooth/+/2038803 to review, will follow up with backports after merge.\nEven making this solution more robust will bring unwanted complexity (at least at this point). Probably a refactor of how the config cache is stored and retrieved could bring more flexibility to the line size (in a future Android release), but for now, keeping the same parsing and just increasing the limit to a reasonable value used also in other devices will have effective results.\n\nWe can put this CL in standby and abandon it after aosp/2038803 gets merged and achieves the desired fix.",
      "parentUuid": "e97bde2f_fd037b11",
      "revId": "c4e515a8e8cc25bd447a0fcc09ccb8fffb46498b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
