      "message": "I also very agree with this point(Even making this solution more robust will bring unwanted complexity)",
      "parentUuid": "670c5a71_ed67905b",
      "revId": "c4e515a8e8cc25bd447a0fcc09ccb8fffb46498b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "72130b60_6c7e7d95",
        "filename": "system/osi/src/config.cc",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 534,
      "author": {
        "id": 1659435
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-03-23T10:43:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "According to https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/gd/storage/config_cache.cc;drc\u003d8c76de22f9ac85e2330eb3abee1c5870ccf66963;l\u003d61 the config cache is stored as an unordered set, so saving it to a file and reading it later will NOT guarantee that the \"HidDesLength\" will be before the \"HidDescriptor\" for the memory realloc to happen, so this is open for race conditions.",
      "revId": "c4e515a8e8cc25bd447a0fcc09ccb8fffb46498b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c1d5278a_beddc86b",
        "filename": "system/osi/src/config.cc",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 534,
      "author": {
        "id": 1943896
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-03-24T06:03:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am sorry that I don\u0027t consider unordered set, in this case, this solution is bad solution",
      "parentUuid": "72130b60_6c7e7d95",
      "revId": "c4e515a8e8cc25bd447a0fcc09ccb8fffb46498b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
