      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-03-23T10:43:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s not clear why the line length is incremented with twice the size of the descriptor.",
      "revId": "c4e515a8e8cc25bd447a0fcc09ccb8fffb46498b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9a1f239f_d950b294",
        "filename": "system/osi/src/config.cc",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 537,
      "author": {
        "id": 1943896
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-03-24T06:03:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "because Descriptor is uint_8 type, \nwhen storage Descriptor, such as 0x25, it will become character \u00272\u0027\u00275\u0027 in cache, so the line length will incremented with twice.",
      "parentUuid": "88b540a7_33df6d1b",
      "revId": "c4e515a8e8cc25bd447a0fcc09ccb8fffb46498b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
