        "filename": "system/osi/src/config.cc",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 537,
      "author": {
        "id": 1659435
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-03-24T08:13:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, but why add it to the existing line_length and not just replace it with something like (sizeof(\"HidDesLength \u003d \") + 2 * hidDesLen), is it for safety? In any case, not important at this point.",
      "parentUuid": "9a1f239f_d950b294",
      "revId": "c4e515a8e8cc25bd447a0fcc09ccb8fffb46498b",
